{"id":"n41923-1-7","stage":3,"title":"다행스럽다 · 所幸","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41923-1-7-1","ko":"너 어제 지갑을 잃어버렸다면서?","zh":"你昨天不是说丢了钱包吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑을","audio":"/audio/5da093412be3fce76db0.mp3"}},{"text":"잃어버렸다면서?","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃어버렸다면서","audio":"/audio/0e71c4795033dfc16b14.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"9cf