":"연락이","meaning":"联络，联系","explanation":"연락：联络，联系；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연락","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14013","senseId":"1","lemma":"연락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연락이","audio":"/audio/5939c757dc359a5f6c8a.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어.","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"30c94182141ace2f","term":"그런데","zh":"可是，可","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3","entryId":"70717","definition":"用于将话题与前面内容相连接的同时，又将话头转向其他方向。","pronunciation":["그런데"]},{"id":"4909de867f486742","term":"다행스럽다","zh":"所幸，幸运","audio":"/audio/4909de867f486742915c.mp3","entryId":"41923","definition":"情况比预想的好，运气似乎很好。","pronunciation":["다행스럽따"]},{"id":"d7c352449c7960ec","term":"경찰서","zh":"警察署，警察局，公安局","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3","entryId":"25960","definition":"负责一个地区的公安工作的官厅。","pronunciation":["경ː찰써"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"b1c3b94a6a87c1f5","term":"연락","zh":"联络，联系","audio":"/audio/b1c3b94a6a87c1f5d675.mp3","entryId":"14013","definition":"传达告知某个事实。","pronunciation":["열락"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c41168cc2741019c2a3b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.127,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?